
### Register a student for a course
POST http://localhost:8088/registration/student/1/course/11
Content-Type: application/json


### Try registering the same student twice
POST http://localhost:8088/registration/student/1/course/1
Content-Type: application/json

###get registration
GET http://localhost:8088/registration/student/1

### Cancel a registration
DELETE http://localhost:8088/registration/1

### Register student 1 for course 1 again
POST http://localhost:8088/registration/student/1/course/11
